@startuml get_number_unit

' Zoom level 2: the component opened at its units. unit_1 keeps the exit to
' the platform; unit_2 is new inside the component.

actor App
participant unit_1 <<unit>>
participant unit_2 <<unit>>
participant Platform <<external>>

App -> unit_1 : GetNumber()
activate unit_1
unit_1 -> unit_2 : GetData()
activate unit_2
return Data*
unit_1 -> Platform : Log()
unit_1 --> App : number
deactivate unit_1

@enduml
